  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the \303\211clat Wear Site**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing a visual sample and interactive mockup for the \"\303\211clat Wear\" website frontend. The aesthetic is key: highly aesthetic, feminine, and sophisticated. I\'m prioritizing visuals that convey a premium feel.\n\n\n**Defining the Interface Structure**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out the interface structure, starting with a fully responsive design. The visual identity revolves around a Lavender Blush background and Night Bordeaux CTAs. Active states and hovers will be Cherry Rose, with Pastel Pink for borders. Typography will use Playfair Display for headings and Montserrat for body text. The navbar, hero section, and product section are taking shape, with placeholder images and a \"A\303\261adir al carrito\" button.\n\n\n**Refining the Interactions**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into interactive elements. I am adding a \"VIP Size Consultation\" button that simulates WhatsApp redirection, and making the \"A\303\261adir al carrito\" button update a visual shopping cart counter. I\'m prioritizing modal development for a \"VIP Size Finder,\" a cart drawer, a search dropdown, and a newsletter sign-up. I\'m focusing on the implementation, with a React, Tailwind CSS, clean code base. I\'m keeping a client-side architecture in mind!\n\n\n**Implementing Motion & Metadata**\n\nI\'m now integrating `motion` for animations, confirming its installation via the package list. I\'ve switched to importing from `motion/react`. I\'m also addressing the `metadata.json` file. I\'ll be renaming the app, specifically the \"name\" field, to a more descriptive and literal title, likely \"Eclat Wear - Prototipo\" or \"Eclat Wear Web\".\n\n\n**Naming the Prototype**\n\nI\'ve decided on the project\'s name: \"\303\211clat Wear - Tienda de Fajas\" which I feel aptly represents the business. I also did a skill check, and image generation seems relevant, to view or generate a matching banner, potentially. I\'ll stick with Unsplash or vector patterns if needed.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I am going to check the configuration and current metadata of the applet."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 242573990
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
