    modified_response: "I am going to build our first elegant assistant component: `/src/components/VipModal.tsx`. This is an interactive VIP Size Consultant widget. The customer enters their bust, waist, and hip measurements, and our algorithms calculate their ideal scientific \"\303\211clat Size\". Once analyzed, it displays a success report with an exclusive button to sync directly to private expert advice via WhatsApp!"
