    modified_response: "I am going to build `/src/components/Navbar.tsx` now. This component implements our upper responsive navigational banner. It features:\n1. Brand Logo: \"\303\211clat Wear\" styled in spacious luxury serif typeface with letters spacing.\n2. Search Overlay: Clicking the Search icon displays a gorgeous overlay search bar to query garments interactively.\n3. Interactive Shopping bag: Clicking the shopping bag opens the `CartDrawer` right side menu, displaying a responsive count of added items.\n4. Membership Trigger: Clicking \"Registro/Unirse\" launches the simulated `RegisterModal` immediately.\n5. Fully Mobile Responsive navigation menu using an elegant drawer transition."
